{"seq":1,"slug":"port-inspection-targeting-model","title":"口岸查验模式与检疫布控命中逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ispm15-wood-packaging-phytosanitary-customs-compliance/customs-inspection-interception-response/port-inspection-targeting-model","wordCount":3247,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"口岸查验模式与检疫布控命中逻辑\">口岸查验模式与检疫布控命中逻辑</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一票从越南发往欧盟的家具货柜，在鹿特丹港被系统自动标记为&quot;需查验&quot;，理由是它的随附单证里申报了实木托；同一航次另一票货柜则直接放行。决定这两条不同路径的，不是查验官员的临场判断，而是一套在货物抵港前就已经运行完毕的**风险布控（targeting）**机制。布控回答&quot;查谁&quot;，查验回答&quot;怎么查&quot;，命中（hit）回答&quot;这条规则有没有真正拦下目标&quot;。三者串起来，才是木质包装检疫在口岸侧的真实动作。</p>\n<p>先把术语固定下来。<strong>布控</strong>指海关或国家植物保护组织（NPPO）依据风险参数，从海量报关单中筛出高风险批次并下达查验指令的过程；<strong>命中</strong>指被布控的批次在口岸实际被指令扣留并进入查验队列，它是布控指令与货物到港事件的交集；<strong>查验</strong>指对命中的批次执行单证审核、现场检验、抽样送检等具体动作。ISPM 15 本身只规定木质包装的处理与标识要求，它不规定各国怎么布控——布控属于 ISPM 20《植物检疫进口监管体系指南》与 ISPM 23《检验指南》覆盖的范畴，由各缔约国自行实现。下表先厘清四种常见查验通道的差别。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查验通道</th>\n<th>触发依据</th>\n<th>动作强度</th>\n<th>典型耗时</th>\n<th>对木质包装的意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单证审核（documentary）</td>\n<td>单证缺失或申报不一致</td>\n<td>只核对文件</td>\n<td>数小时</td>\n<td>核对处理证书、IPPC 标识声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标识查验（marking check）</td>\n<td>申报含实木包装</td>\n<td>目视核查印记</td>\n<td>数小时–1 天</td>\n<td>核验 IPPC 标识与国家码、处理码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现场检验（physical）</td>\n<td>风险命中或随机抽中</td>\n<td>开箱、目视、抽样</td>\n<td>1–5 天</td>\n<td>查实木部件、虫孔、活虫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽样送检（laboratory）</td>\n<td>现场疑似有害生物</td>\n<td>实验室鉴定</td>\n<td>3–14 天</td>\n<td>确认是否为检疫性有害生物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[报关单 + 单证抵达] --&gt; B[风险参数引擎评分]&#10;    B --&gt; C{风险分超过阈值?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[电子放行]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[下达布控指令]&#10;    E --&gt; F[货物抵港事件]&#10;    F --&gt; G[命中: 进入查验队列]&#10;    G --&gt; H[单证审核]&#10;    H --&gt; I{单证合规?}&#10;    I --&gt;|否| J[直接判定不合格]&#10;    I --&gt;|是| K[现场标识与实木检验]&#10;    K --&gt; L{发现活虫/标识造假?}&#10;    L --&gt;|否| D&#10;    L --&gt;|是| M[抽样送检 + 处置判定]&#10;    M --&gt; N[放行/处理/退运/销毁]\">flowchart TD\n    A[报关单 + 单证抵达] --&gt; B[风险参数引擎评分]\n    B --&gt; C{风险分超过阈值?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[电子放行]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[下达布控指令]\n    E --&gt; F[货物抵港事件]\n    F --&gt; G[命中: 进入查验队列]\n    G --&gt; H[单证审核]\n    H --&gt; I{单证合规?}\n    I --&gt;|否| J[直接判定不合格]\n    I --&gt;|是| K[现场标识与实木检验]\n    K --&gt; L{发现活虫/标识造假?}\n    L --&gt;|否| D\n    L --&gt;|是| M[抽样送检 + 处置判定]\n    M --&gt; N[放行/处理/退运/销毁]</pre><h2 id=\"风险布控-从随机抽查到风险画像\">风险布控：从随机抽查到风险画像</h2><p>早期口岸检疫普遍采用<strong>固定比例随机抽查</strong>，例如每 100 票抽 3 票。这种做法的缺陷是显然的：抽检比例与真实风险无关，命中率（命中批次中查出问题的比例）通常只有个位数百分比，却对合规企业施加了均匀的滞留成本。2020 年代各国 NPPO 普遍转向<strong>风险导向布控</strong>——用一组参数给每票货打分，超过阈值才布控。这套逻辑与集装箱安检、反欺诈模型同源：把有限的查验能力投向边际收益最高的批次。</p>\n<p>布控评分通常是一个加权线性组合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>布控</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i x_i, \\qquad \\text{布控} \\iff R \\ge \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">布控</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是归一化后的风险因子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是布控阈值。木质包装相关的典型因子及其方向如下表。注意权重是各国自定的、通常不公开完整清单——这本身就是一种监管策略，避免出口商反向优化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险因子</th>\n<th>取值方向</th>\n<th>与木质包装的关联</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原产国/地区的检疫状况</td>\n<td>疫区加分</td>\n<td>松材线虫、天牛疫区来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申报包装材质</td>\n<td>实木加分、人造板减分</td>\n<td>实木是 ISPM 15 管制对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出口商历史违规记录</td>\n<td>违规次数加分</td>\n<td>重复违规者持续布控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理厂编号可信度</td>\n<td>未授权厂加分</td>\n<td>IPPC 标识含生产商号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品本身是否为植物产品</td>\n<td>植物产品大幅加分</td>\n<td>叠加商品检疫风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>航线与季节</td>\n<td>高发期加分</td>\n<td>害虫活动季节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单证一致性</td>\n<td>不一致加分</td>\n<td>申报与随附文件冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机项</td>\n<td>全体小额加分</td>\n<td>保留基础抽检覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行很关键：<strong>纯风险模型会系统性忽略&quot;尚未被识别的新风险&quot;</strong>。若某国某处理厂首次出现标识造假，历史模型不会给它加分。因此成熟体系会保留一个小的随机通道（randomized control），它同时承担两个功能——维持对未知风险的抽样覆盖，以及为模型提供无偏的基准命中率，用于校准权重。经验上随机通道命中率是评估模型增益的对照基线：若风险通道命中率并不显著高于随机通道，说明评分权重需要重估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽样与命中概率-ispm-31-的统计基础\">抽样与命中概率：ISPM 31 的统计基础</h2><p>布控决定&quot;查哪票&quot;，抽样决定&quot;一票里查多少件&quot;。这两层经常被混淆。ISPM 31《货物抽样方法》给出的核心洞见是：<strong>在有害生物低流行率下，抽样件数与检出概率呈强非线性关系</strong>，直觉上&quot;抽了 30 件没发现，应该没问题&quot;往往是错的。</p>\n<p>设一批共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 件，其中实际有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 件被污染（携带活虫），随机抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 件，则<strong>一件都抽不到污染件</strong>的概率服从超几何分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>未检出</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>N</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{未检出}) = \\frac{\\binom{N-M}{n}}{\\binom{N}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">未检出</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8247em;vertical-align:-1.1623em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6623em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1877em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1623em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因此至少检出一次的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>检出</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>未检出</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{检出}) = 1 - P(\\text{未检出})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">检出</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">未检出</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 很大、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 很小时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>检出</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{检出}) \\approx 1 - (1-p)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">检出</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = M/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是污染率。这个近似式揭示了一个残酷的算术：若污染率只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span>，抽 60 件仍只有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">45\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45%</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率检出（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>0.99</mn><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.45</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-0.99^{60}\\approx 0.45</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.45</span></span></span></span></span>）；要把检出概率提到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span>，需要抽约 230 件。这解释了两个现实：其一，木质包装的检疫判定高度依赖<strong>标识与处理合规性核验</strong>而非&quot;抽到活虫&quot;，因为抽到活虫本身是小概率事件；其二，一旦某批次被抽到活虫，往往是污染率已相当高——它更可能是系统性失效（如整批处理未达标）的信号，而非零星污染。</p>\n<p>ISPM 31 因此把抽样方法按目的分类：用于<strong>检出</strong>（detection）的方法追求在给定置信水平下最大化检出概率；用于<strong>估计</strong>（estimation）的方法追求无偏估计污染率的精度。检疫现场的布控抽检属于前者，其参数（件数、置信水平）由各国在 ISPM 31 框架内自定，常以&quot;95% 置信度下能检出 1% 污染率&quot;之类的口径标定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"布控命中后的查验执行与判定\">布控命中后的查验执行与判定</h2><p>命中只是把批次拽进队列，真正的判定发生在查验台上。木质包装的现场查验有一条与普通商品不同的主线索：<strong>先查标识，再查实体</strong>。因为 ISPM 15 的合规性是&quot;处理 + 加施标识&quot;的组合，一个印记完整、可由处理厂编号追溯的托盘，其风险已被标准前置削减；反之，印记缺失、模糊、或编号无法对应授权处理厂的，即使外观完好也直接判定不合格。</p>\n<p>现场判定按决策顺序展开。<strong>第一步核验 IPPC 标识的完整性</strong>：标识须含 IPPC 符号、国家代码（ISO 3166 两字母码）、授权处理厂编号、处理方式代码（HT 热处理、MB 溴甲烷熏蒸、DH 介电加热等）。任何一项缺失或被篡改即命中不合格。<strong>第二步核验实木部件</strong>：开箱后须区分哪些是受管制的实木、哪些是豁免的加工木材（胶合板、刨花板、OSB 等）。实操中最常见的漏判是把&quot;看起来像人造板&quot;的包装箱当成整体豁免，但箱内仍有实木方料或垫木——判别按材料而非外观。<strong>第三步目视检验有害生物痕迹</strong>：虫孔、蛀屑、活虫、菌丝体。发现疑似活虫即抽样送检，进入实验室鉴定流程，同时该批次在鉴定结果出来前处于扣留状态。</p>\n<p>这里有一个工程上常被忽视的接口：<strong>布控指令与查验资源的匹配</strong>。若某时段布控指令集中落在同一港口，查验通道会排队，实际命中到开箱的时延被拉长。因此风险引擎通常还要与通道容量联合优化——把布控强度与可用查验台位数、送检实验室产能联动，否则&quot;高命中率&quot;会以不可接受的滞留时长为代价。滞留成本对跨境电商尤其敏感，因为木质包装的滞留会连带整柜货物停摆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命中后的处置判定与放行逻辑\">命中后的处置判定与放行逻辑</h2><p>查出不合格后，处置不是单一动作，而是一个按严重度分级的判定树。各国的实施细节不同，但逻辑大体遵循 ISPM 20 与 ISPM 13《不合格通告与紧急行动指南》的框架：<strong>能就地补救的优先处理，不能补救的退运或销毁，并把不合格事实通告出口国 NPPO</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指定处理（treatment）</strong>：标识缺失或处理参数不达标的，在口岸由授权机构重新实施热处理或熏蒸，费用与滞留由货主承担，处理后放行。这是最&quot;轻&quot;的处置，适用于包装本身可用、仅合规形式有瑕疵的情形。</li>\n<li><strong>退运（return/refusal）</strong>：处理不可行（如熏蒸设施不可用、时限不允许）或货主拒绝处理时，整批退回原产国。</li>\n<li><strong>销毁（destruction）</strong>：检出检疫性有害生物且无法有效处理时，按当地生物安全规定销毁，通常由货主承担成本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>处置判定的时延与成本结构差异很大：指定处理以&quot;天&quot;计，退运以&quot;周–月&quot;计并叠加双向运费，销毁直接损失货值。对跨境电商卖家而言，一票因木质包装被销毁的货，其损失往往远超包装本身成本——这正是 ISPM 15 合规投入（热处理、加施标识、单证核对）的正当性来源。一个可量化的决策是：在货物价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>、退运概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、销毁概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、处理成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下，事前合规的期望节省为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>节省</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>退运</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>销毁</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{节省}] = p_r \\cdot (C_{\\text{退运}} - C_t) + p_d \\cdot (V + C_{\\text{销毁}} - C_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节省</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">退运</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">销毁</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要等式右侧为正，事前拿处理厂证明就是划算的——对高价值、高检疫风险的品类几乎总是如此。</p>\n<p>不合格事实还会以**通告（notification）**形式回流到出口国。EU 侧的这条链路自 2020 年起由 EUROPHYT 迁移到 TRACES 系统承载，数据覆盖 2022 年起，每月 6 日与 21 日两次刷新（food.ec.europa.eu）。中国侧由海关总署（GACC）作为 NPPO 接收并核查异常批次，美国侧由 USDA-APHIS 负责进口木质包装的查验与执法。对出口企业，这意味着一次口岸不合格不会被&quot;就地消化&quot;，它进入出口国监管档案，并影响后续布控权重——即上表中的&quot;出口商历史违规记录&quot;因子会因此加分，形成自我强化的监管记忆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>布控决定查谁，查验决定怎么查，命中是两者的交集</strong>；三者分属 ISPM 20 / 23 与各国自建的风险引擎，而非 ISPM 15 本身。</li>\n<li>风险布控以加权风险分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=\\sum w_i x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 圈定批次；木质包装的关键因子是原产风险、实木申报、历史违规与处理厂编号可信度，且<strong>必须保留随机通道</strong>以覆盖未知风险并为模型提供对照基线。</li>\n<li>抽样检出概率服从超几何分布，低污染率下检出极难——<strong>1% 污染率抽 60 件仅约 45% 检出概率</strong>；因此木质包装检疫的判定重心落在标识与处理合规核验，而非&quot;抽到活虫&quot;。</li>\n<li>现场查验遵循<strong>先标识、再实体、后送检</strong>的顺序；豁免判定按材料而非外观，垫木、方料等非显性实木件是高频漏判项。</li>\n<li>处置按严重度分级为指定处理、退运、销毁，并按 ISPM 13 通告出口国 NPPO；不合格记录会回流布控权重，形成跨批次的监管记忆。</li>\n<li>布控强度须与查验台位、实验室产能联合优化，否则高命中率会以不可接受的滞留时长反噬跨境电商的履约时效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本馆对木质包装的合规处理参数（热处理温度—时间、熏蒸浓度—时间）另见同馆文档《热处理与熏蒸参数》，对其在国际标准体系中的法理定位见《ISPM-15 国际标准与植物检疫制度框架》。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"口岸查验模式与检疫布控命中逻辑","id":"口岸查验模式与检疫布控命中逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"风险布控：从随机抽查到风险画像","id":"风险布控-从随机抽查到风险画像"},{"level":2,"text":"抽样与命中概率：ISPM 31 的统计基础","id":"抽样与命中概率-ispm-31-的统计基础"},{"level":2,"text":"布控命中后的查验执行与判定","id":"布控命中后的查验执行与判定"},{"level":2,"text":"命中后的处置判定与放行逻辑","id":"命中后的处置判定与放行逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"处理凭证、证书与数字化凭证链建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ispm15-wood-packaging-phytosanitary-customs-compliance/wood-packaging-treatment-marking-data/treatment-certificate-digital-evidence-chain"},"next":{"title":"截获处置、除害处理与放行流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ispm15-wood-packaging-phytosanitary-customs-compliance/customs-inspection-interception-response/interception-treatment-release-process"}}